{
 "npc.vesk|\"If you're here to watch, stand further back. If you're here to be useful, I'm short of sand.\"": "vo_vesk_76eedef8bb5d",
 "npc.vesk|If you're here to watch, stand further back. If you're here to be useful, I'm short of sand.": "vo_vesk_76eedef8bb5d",
 "npc.vesk|\"White. Off the bank where the water sorts it — the current does the sieving, I don't have to.\"": "vo_vesk_828f8bc2496a",
 "npc.vesk|White. Off the bank where the water sorts it — the current does the sieving, I don't have to.": "vo_vesk_828f8bc2496a",
 "npc.vesk|\"Three measures. Don't scoop the grey, it's got iron in it and it'll spit at me.\"": "vo_vesk_3000a8f41f5d",
 "npc.vesk|Three measures. Don't scoop the grey, it's got iron in it and it'll spit at me.": "vo_vesk_3000a8f41f5d",
 "npc.vesk|\"Well?\"": "vo_vesk_ea0d7e0c3385",
 "npc.vesk|Well?": "vo_vesk_ea0d7e0c3385",
 "npc.vesk|\"Right. You've seen the whole of it now — the sand, the heat, the cooling. That's the work.\"": "vo_vesk_a8a6dfa549df",
 "npc.vesk|Right. You've seen the whole of it now — the sand, the heat, the cooling. That's the work.": "vo_vesk_a8a6dfa549df",
 "npc.vesk|\"Come and grind whatever you like. Blanks, reading glass, the wide sort, the burning sort. You know where the kiln is.\"": "vo_vesk_20c83f5a378a",
 "npc.vesk|Come and grind whatever you like. Blanks, reading glass, the wide sort, the burning sort. You know where the kiln is.": "vo_vesk_20c83f5a378a",
 "npc.vesk|\"Coll's been up here twice asking about that plate of his. The one at the gear housing.\"": "vo_vesk_e0efd1b13974",
 "npc.vesk|Coll's been up here twice asking about that plate of his. The one at the gear housing.": "vo_vesk_e0efd1b13974",
 "npc.vesk|\"Cut stone, weathered flat. You'd need to bring your eye to within an inch of it, and nobody's eye works at an inch.\"": "vo_vesk_3d6abedd2595",
 "npc.vesk|Cut stone, weathered flat. You'd need to bring your eye to within an inch of it, and nobody's eye works at an inch.": "vo_vesk_3d6abedd2595",
 "npc.vesk|\"A reading lens. Blank first, then grind it down. Flat on the rim so it sits on the stone without rocking.\"": "vo_vesk_49aceec7e668",
 "npc.vesk|A reading lens. Blank first, then grind it down. Flat on the rim so it sits on the stone without rocking.": "vo_vesk_49aceec7e668",
 "npc.vesk|\"It's not difficult. It's just fussy, and Coll's hands shake now.\"": "vo_vesk_f85e12eee669",
 "npc.vesk|It's not difficult. It's just fussy, and Coll's hands shake now.": "vo_vesk_f85e12eee669",
 "npc.vesk|\"Let's see it, then.\"": "vo_vesk_dbf695983fe7",
 "npc.vesk|Let's see it, then.": "vo_vesk_dbf695983fe7",
 "npc.vesk|\"Hm. That'll read stone. Take it to him before he asks me a third time.\"": "vo_vesk_862b44042862",
 "npc.vesk|Hm. That'll read stone. Take it to him before he asks me a third time.": "vo_vesk_862b44042862",
 "npc.vesk|\"...That's not mine. That's not anyone's I know of. The grind on that is better than mine and it's been in the water twenty years.\"": "vo_vesk_007f01ad24f7",
 "npc.vesk|...That's not mine. That's not anyone's I know of. The grind on that is better than mine and it's been in the water twenty years.": "vo_vesk_007f01ad24f7",
 "npc.vesk|He hands it back, and does not entirely let go of it first.": "vo_narrator_86c077288316",
 "npc.vesk|\"Well. It'll read the plate. Whoever made it could grind, I'll say that.\"": "vo_vesk_95ac36304297",
 "npc.vesk|Well. It'll read the plate. Whoever made it could grind, I'll say that.": "vo_vesk_95ac36304297",
 "npc.vesk|\"You've got that grey on your sleeve. Off the eastern trees, is it?\"": "vo_vesk_b561cd92cf4b",
 "npc.vesk|You've got that grey on your sleeve. Off the eastern trees, is it?": "vo_vesk_b561cd92cf4b",
 "npc.vesk|He rubs it between finger and thumb, and stops moving.": "vo_narrator_9b775fb58396",
 "npc.vesk|\"That's kiln ash. Not wood ash — kiln. Fired hot, fired long, and gone through twice.\"": "vo_vesk_2d74efd3a1f7",
 "npc.vesk|That's kiln ash. Not wood ash — kiln. Fired hot, fired long, and gone through twice.": "vo_vesk_2d74efd3a1f7",
 "npc.vesk|\"My kiln was cold on the last Quietday. Cold from the night before, and I can show you the bricks.\"": "vo_vesk_5e2aa77afb18",
 "npc.vesk|My kiln was cold on the last Quietday. Cold from the night before, and I can show you the bricks.": "vo_vesk_5e2aa77afb18",
 "npc.vesk|\"So who's firing?\"": "vo_vesk_3deb8cf5dad8",
 "npc.vesk|So who's firing?": "vo_vesk_3deb8cf5dad8",
 "npc.vesk|\"It's at temperature. I'm not talking through the good part.\"": "vo_vesk_b56075d8ca61",
 "npc.vesk|It's at temperature. I'm not talking through the good part.": "vo_vesk_b56075d8ca61",
 "npc.coll|\"You've seen the grate, then. Choked since spring, and cracked before that.\"": "vo_coll_96188599cf29",
 "npc.coll|You've seen the grate, then. Choked since spring, and cracked before that.": "vo_coll_96188599cf29",
 "npc.coll|\"I can clear it or I can climb down to it. Not both, not any more.\"": "vo_coll_4143c34adab0",
 "npc.coll|I can clear it or I can climb down to it. Not both, not any more.": "vo_coll_4143c34adab0",
 "npc.coll|\"Keeps the channel from swallowing something it can't pass. That's all a grate is.\"": "vo_coll_f6730f94fc25",
 "npc.coll|Keeps the channel from swallowing something it can't pass. That's all a grate is.": "vo_coll_f6730f94fc25",
 "npc.coll|\"Mind — it's not the grate that matters. It's what you can do once it holds.\"": "vo_coll_9df3e6c2d9f0",
 "npc.coll|Mind — it's not the grate that matters. It's what you can do once it holds.": "vo_coll_9df3e6c2d9f0",
 "npc.coll|\"Pull the weed out first, all of it, or you'll mend around a blockage and feel clever about it.\"": "vo_coll_800b24472d91",
 "npc.coll|Pull the weed out first, all of it, or you'll mend around a blockage and feel clever about it.": "vo_coll_800b24472d91",
 "npc.coll|\"Then you'll want iron. Flat bar, hand's length. There's some up on the shelf where they left it.\"": "vo_coll_19df26ffbb80",
 "npc.coll|Then you'll want iron. Flat bar, hand's length. There's some up on the shelf where they left it.": "vo_coll_19df26ffbb80",
 "npc.coll|\"Three paddles and a head gate. The paddles set the share, the head gate lets it go.\"": "vo_coll_fa4f25b09e89",
 "npc.coll|Three paddles and a head gate. The paddles set the share, the head gate lets it go.": "vo_coll_fa4f25b09e89",
 "npc.coll|\"The settings are on the plate. Don't guess them — guessing them is how the last man flooded the low road.\"": "vo_coll_8bc083cc0726",
 "npc.coll|The settings are on the plate. Don't guess them — guessing them is how the last man flooded the low road.": "vo_coll_8bc083cc0726",
 "npc.coll|\"And dawn. Only dawn. There's no push in it any other hour.\"": "vo_coll_6bd8698e4720",
 "npc.coll|And dawn. Only dawn. There's no push in it any other hour.": "vo_coll_6bd8698e4720",
 "npc.coll|\"Kiln ash on the leaves.\" He says it the way you'd agree about rain. \"Aye, that'll be the warm mornings.\"": "vo_coll_8e84cf41b70b",
 "npc.coll|Kiln ash on the leaves. Aye, that'll be the warm mornings.": "vo_coll_8e84cf41b70b",
 "npc.coll|\"Water at the head gate comes up warm on a Quietday. Warm to the wrist. Always has.\"": "vo_coll_07d665c99c3f",
 "npc.coll|Water at the head gate comes up warm on a Quietday. Warm to the wrist. Always has.": "vo_coll_07d665c99c3f",
 "npc.coll|He notices you have stopped moving.": "vo_narrator_3117a4e23c35",
 "npc.coll|\"...That's not usual, is it.\"": "vo_coll_42f18f78d8a2",
 "npc.coll|...That's not usual, is it.": "vo_coll_42f18f78d8a2",
 "npc.coll|He knows before you say it. He puts his hands on his knees again.": "vo_narrator_c6ef9d597d1b",
 "npc.coll|\"I am,\" he says. \"Have been. Thirty year, near enough.\"": "vo_coll_4d7789d47c01",
 "npc.coll|I am, Have been. Thirty year, near enough.": "vo_coll_4d7789d47c01",
 "npc.coll|\"Sile had it before me. She took me down there the once, showed me the bank and the length to cut the fuel, and told me never to let it out.\"": "vo_coll_543811d1e3a1",
 "npc.coll|Sile had it before me. She took me down there the once, showed me the bank and the length to cut the fuel, and told me never to let it out.": "vo_coll_543811d1e3a1",
 "npc.coll|\"I asked her why. She said she asked too, and got the same answer I'm giving you.\"": "vo_coll_d761ca1267c5",
 "npc.coll|I asked her why. She said she asked too, and got the same answer I'm giving you.": "vo_coll_d761ca1267c5",
 "npc.coll|He looks at the water.": "vo_narrator_5ed0ea92eabc",
 "npc.coll|\"It wants to stay warm down there. That's all I know, and I'd rather be the fool who kept it lit than the one who found out.\"": "vo_coll_692e276e9b2f",
 "npc.coll|It wants to stay warm down there. That's all I know, and I'd rather be the fool who kept it lit than the one who found out.": "vo_coll_692e276e9b2f",
 "npc.coll|\"Water's doing what it does. I'm watching in case it stops.\"": "vo_coll_e2154b73ef1e",
 "npc.coll|Water's doing what it does. I'm watching in case it stops.": "vo_coll_e2154b73ef1e",
 "npc.orrel|\"You walk the shelf. Good. I need a number and I need it twice.\"": "vo_orrel_67fc975bab16",
 "npc.orrel|You walk the shelf. Good. I need a number and I need it twice.": "vo_orrel_67fc975bab16",
 "npc.orrel|\"The sunmoss on the shaded bank. How many are open at dawn, and how many at dusk.\"": "vo_orrel_c3477ef9bdc2",
 "npc.orrel|The sunmoss on the shaded bank. How many are open at dawn, and how many at dusk.": "vo_orrel_c3477ef9bdc2",
 "npc.orrel|\"Because one number is an opinion.\"": "vo_orrel_c985099699b0",
 "npc.orrel|Because one number is an opinion.": "vo_orrel_c985099699b0",
 "npc.orrel|She finally looks up.": "vo_narrator_b9d4105b94ee",
 "npc.orrel|\"Everyone here says the moss is worthless because it grows wrong. Nobody has counted it. I would like to be the one holding the count when that stops being true.\"": "vo_orrel_fc14faff1c07",
 "npc.orrel|Everyone here says the moss is worthless because it grows wrong. Nobody has counted it. I would like to be the one holding the count when that stops being true.": "vo_orrel_fc14faff1c07",
 "npc.orrel|\"Shaded bank, off the upper shelf. Dawn first, then dusk — in that order, or the second number means nothing.\"": "vo_orrel_2b719a12ecc1",
 "npc.orrel|Shaded bank, off the upper shelf. Dawn first, then dusk — in that order, or the second number means nothing.": "vo_orrel_2b719a12ecc1",
 "npc.orrel|\"Well? Both of them.\"": "vo_orrel_8f1bbce932aa",
 "npc.orrel|Well? Both of them.": "vo_orrel_8f1bbce932aa",
 "npc.orrel|She writes it down, underlines it, and sits back.": "vo_narrator_bde45470ee28",
 "npc.orrel|\"Four times the yield at dusk. Four. And every carter who comes through this valley collects at noon because that is when carters like to work.\"": "vo_orrel_5237de2009a0",
 "npc.orrel|Four times the yield at dusk. Four. And every carter who comes through this valley collects at noon because that is when carters like to work.": "vo_orrel_5237de2009a0",
 "npc.orrel|\"Right. I'm opening a post on the west bank, and I am buying moss at dusk prices.\"": "vo_orrel_92eb3dd80238",
 "npc.orrel|Right. I'm opening a post on the west bank, and I am buying moss at dusk prices.": "vo_orrel_92eb3dd80238",
 "npc.orrel|\"Tell people. Tell them I said the number.\"": "vo_orrel_06877314de61",
 "npc.orrel|Tell people. Tell them I said the number.": "vo_orrel_06877314de61",
 "npc.orrel|\"The post is standing and nobody has used it, which makes it a shed.\"": "vo_orrel_db6790a500e7",
 "npc.orrel|The post is standing and nobody has used it, which makes it a shed.": "vo_orrel_db6790a500e7",
 "npc.orrel|\"Bring me moss across my own counter until I have three slips written. Then it is a trade post.\"": "vo_orrel_5fa3dc402f73",
 "npc.orrel|Bring me moss across my own counter until I have three slips written. Then it is a trade post.": "vo_orrel_5fa3dc402f73",
 "npc.orrel|\"Two moss a slip. I am not being generous — I am establishing a rate, and the first rate is the one that sticks.\"": "vo_orrel_42ef018f4276",
 "npc.orrel|Two moss a slip. I am not being generous — I am establishing a rate, and the first rate is the one that sticks.": "vo_orrel_42ef018f4276",
 "npc.orrel|\"Slips.\"": "vo_orrel_f5058481faa3",
 "npc.orrel|Slips.": "vo_orrel_f5058481faa3",
 "npc.orrel|She takes all three, files them, and writes a fourth thing that she does not show you.": "vo_narrator_107d0e6e77cb",
 "npc.orrel|\"That is a trading post with a history now. Small history. Still a history.\"": "vo_orrel_86560cd384c8",
 "npc.orrel|That is a trading post with a history now. Small history. Still a history.": "vo_orrel_86560cd384c8",
 "npc.orrel|\"It has been a wall my whole life and this morning it is a road.\"": "vo_orrel_144313c038d8",
 "npc.orrel|It has been a wall my whole life and this morning it is a road.": "vo_orrel_144313c038d8",
 "npc.orrel|\"Take the other handle. And keep it slow on the cut — a loaded cart on a slope stops being yours very quickly.\"": "vo_orrel_d676306c8d3d",
 "npc.orrel|Take the other handle. And keep it slow on the cut — a loaded cart on a slope stops being yours very quickly.": "vo_orrel_d676306c8d3d",
 "npc.orrel|\"I am three columns from a total. Come back when I am four.\"": "vo_orrel_51a851ea715e",
 "npc.orrel|I am three columns from a total. Come back when I am four.": "vo_orrel_51a851ea715e",
 "npc.pip|It is doing something. It is not telling you what.": "vo_narrator_a129942dc5c4",
 "npc.pip|Whatever was wrong with the light down there, it does not appear to be wrong up here.": "vo_narrator_d15e9356a155",
 "npc.vesk|Vesk does not look up from the kiln mouth.": "vo_narrator_fd71e5dd3b09",
 "npc.vesk|Vesk takes the sand, weighs it in one hand, and grunts in a way that is apparently approval.": "vo_narrator_707d29465c23",
 "npc.vesk|Vesk turns it against the light, looking for the flaw he expects to find.": "vo_narrator_f534f2c29445",
 "npc.vesk|Vesk takes it, turns it over, and goes quiet for slightly too long.": "vo_narrator_fa3687f5fc25",
 "npc.coll|Coll is sitting on the housing with his hands on his knees, watching water go past.": "vo_narrator_02af64f98f4f",
 "npc.orrel|Orrel does not stop writing.": "vo_narrator_ad42d3b34143",
 "npc.pip|Pip settles on your shoulder, folds down, and holds a steady light.": "vo_narrator_96d9347f0122",
 "npc.pip|Pip will not settle. The light goes thin, comes back, goes thin again.": "vo_narrator_cb2e982926d7",
 "npc.pip|Pip is bright again, and steady, and entirely unbothered.": "vo_narrator_1a8ede0c9796",
 "npc.pip|Pip won't settle. It keeps lifting off your shoulder and drifting east, toward the stand of trees past the climb, then coming back as if to check you're following.": "vo_narrator_0ec6d4a6ea19",
 "npc.pip|When you stop walking, it hangs in the air facing the shelf. The light is doing something it doesn't usually do — thinning at the edges.": "vo_narrator_6131663e8c69"
}
